  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 50,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kubo: Ngiqinisile ngithi kini: Bakhona abanye kwabemiyo lapha abangayikuzwa ukufa, baze babone umbuso kaNkulunkulu usufikile ngamandla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwensuku eziyisithupha uJesu wathatha oPetro, loJakobe, loJohane, wakhwela labo entabeni ende bebodwa; waphenduka isimo phambi kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.1.17+2PE.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 1:17–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingubo zakhe zacwazimula zaba mhlophe nke, kakulamuntu emhlabeni ongazenza zibe mhlophe kangaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabonakala kibo uElija eloMose; babekhuluma loJesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UPetro wathi kuJesu: Mfundisi, kuhle ukuba sibe lapha; asakhe amadumba amathathu, elinye libe ngelakho, elinye libe ngelikaMose, lelinye libe ngelikaElija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayengakwazi angakutsho, ngoba babesesaba kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekufika iyezi, labasibekela; kwezwakala ilizwi eyezini, lathi: Lo uyiNdodana yami ethandekayo; zwanini yona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mark 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi masinyane bethalaza, kababe besabona muntu, kuphela uJesu yedwa owayelabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besehla entabeni, wabalaya ukuba bangatsheli muntu abakubonileyo, ize ivuke kwabafileyo iNdodana yomuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balibamba lelilizwi babuzana bodwa ukuba kutsho ukuthini ukuvuka kwabafileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebembuza besithi: Batsholani ababhali ukuthi uElija ufanele ukufika kuqala na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 11:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaphendula wathi: UElija uzafika kuqala ukubuyisela zonke izinto; kodwa kulotshwe njani ngeNdodana yomuntu ukuthi imele ihlupheke kakhulu, idelelwe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ngithi kini: UElija sewafika, benza kuye lokho abakuthandayo, njengokulotshiweyo ngaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi befika kubafundi, babona ixuku elikhulu libahanqile lababhali bephikisana labo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lathi ukumbona ixuku lonke laselimangala lagijimela kuye, lambingelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebabuza esithi: Libuzana ngani labo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunye wexuku waphendula wathi: Mfundisi, ngilethe kuwe indodana yami elomoya oyisimungulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuthi lapho uyibamba khona, uyilahle phansi, ikhihlize amagwebu, igedle amazinyo, yome qha. Ngicele abafundi bakho ukuba bawukhuphe, kodwa behluleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaphendula wathi: O sizukulwana esingakholwayo, koze kube nini ngilani na? Koze kube nini ngilibekezelela na? Iletheni kimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayiletha kuye. Kwathi umoya umbona, wahle wayihlukuza, yawa phansi, yazigiqagiqa ikhihliza amagwebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasembuza uyise esithi: Ilesikhathi esingakanani ilalokhu na? Wathi: Kusukela ebuntwaneni bayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyiphosele kanengi emlilweni lasemanzini ukuba uyibhubhise; kodwa nxa kukhona ongakwenza, sihawukele, usisize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wathi kuye: Engingakwenza! Zonke izinto ziyenzeka kuye okholwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahle wamemeza uyise womfana, wathi: Ngiyakholwa, siza ukungakholwa kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu esebona ukuba ixuku ligijimela ndawonye, wakhuza umoya omubi, wathi kuwo: Wena moya oyisimungulu longezwayo ngiyakulaya mina: Phuma kuyo, ungabe usangena kuyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usumemezile wayihlukuza kakhulu, waphuma; yaba njengofileyo, kwaze kwathi abanengi bathi: Isifile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uJesu wayibamba ngesandla, wayiphakamisa; yasukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi esengenile endlini, abafundi bakhe bambuza bebodwa, besithi: Kungani sahlulekile thina ukuwukhupha na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
