            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ilowo lalowo ozakulinathisa inkezo yamanzi ngebizo lami, ngoba lingabakaKristu, ngiqinisile ngithi kini: Kayikulahlekelwa ngumvuzo wakhe.",
