        {
          "text": "Ilowo lalowo okhubekisa omunye walaba abancinyane abakholwa kimi kungakuhle kuye ukuba ilitshe lokuchola elikhulu ligaxwe entanyeni yakhe, aphoselwe olwandle. ",
